## Pandit Dr. S. Ballesh Bhajantri & Dr. Krishna Ballesh Bhajantri

### Hindustani Classical Vocalists & Shehnai Artistes

Abhinayपथ is honoured to feature the distinguished father-son duo **Pandit Dr. S. Ballesh Bhajantri** and **Dr. Krishna Ballesh Bhajantri** as artist partners for curated musical concerts, lecture-demonstrations, cultural evenings, and institution-facing programs.

Pandit Dr. S. Ballesh Bhajantri is a Padma Shri awardee, internationally reputed shehnai maestro, Hindustani classical vocalist, playback musician, ghazal and bhajan singer. He carries forward the great shehnai tradition of Bharat Ratna Ustad Bismillah Khan.

Dr. Krishna Ballesh Bhajantri is a Kalaimamani awardee, Hindustani classical vocalist and shehnai artiste, continuing the family’s rich musical legacy with performances across classical, devotional, semi-classical and collaborative formats.

### Available Program Formats

* Pure Hindustani Classical Shehnai Recital
* Hindustani Classical Vocal Recital
* Shehnai Jugalbandi
* Vocal Jugalbandi
* Ghazal, Bhajan, Sufi and Qawwali Evening
* Lecture-Demonstration on the Shehnai Tradition
* Heritage Music Concert for institutions, cultural centres and corporate audiences

Through this collaboration, Abhinayपथ aims to take the living tradition of Hindustani music and shehnai to wider audiences — across cultural institutions, universities, schools, festivals, public platforms and community spaces.

For concert enquiries and institutional collaborations, please contact Abhinayपथ.
